# The AIShiteru Core the front end is checked against, in one place. CI's end
# to end tests run against it (scripts/ci-core.sh), and api/catalogue.json must
# be its tool catalogue. The tag names Core's commit; the digest is what is
# pulled, so the tag moving on changes nothing here.
#
# To move it (README, Moving the Core pin): take the new image's tag and
# digest from the package's page or Core's CI run, write them below, refresh
# api/catalogue.json from a Core of that version, and push both together.
# The digest of sha-a51bc0c is still to be written after the tag
# (@sha256:…). Until it is, ci-core.sh pulls by the tag alone and does not
# compare it with Core's version.
